{"title":"2023 SSMO Relay Round 1 Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_1_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compute the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/3/ef3b03656deedb3efbb50a6f258362cc736c5173.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2022^{2021^{2020^{\\dots}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/0873e9fed23538e535ac05c3284b86bd7bce6fd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2023$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_1_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 SSMO Relay Round 1 Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_1_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/3/3c3051519cf5d47d7be8c47d37e1fa6414f43dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=TNYWR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/8/d4895532c14d74ead078caee2c21eba6197b0d28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0 = 3, a_1 = 1, a_2 = T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"173\" height=\"18\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/9/0f91c465f5696048709ad7dce295ad027e252bc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = a_{n-1} - \\frac{a_{n-3}}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"142\" height=\"34\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b64407fad31162bde1c6f17dd70e54f8e28db8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d916ca4e9ac73751ff00a7a75776bd2eaca943.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=0}^\\infty a_i.\\]\" width=\"47\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_1_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 SSMO Relay Round 1 Problems/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_1_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/3/3c3051519cf5d47d7be8c47d37e1fa6414f43dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=TNYWR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" />. Find the number of solutions to the equation \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed50f1e674d74b015125e05c7737794c09c34a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sec^{T} (Tx) - \\tan^{T}(Tx) = 1\\]\" width=\"200\" height=\"20\" />\nsuch <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/0/320a380886da8e23bc30bc2a9aa5bf9db93cf95d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le x \\le \\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Relay_Round_1_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 SSMO Relay Round 1 Problems/Problem 3\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017083639\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 55/1000000\nPost‐expand includ